00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:25.000
to basically get the MNIST
data, our Hello World,

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.790
and then basically create
two NumPy arrays of that.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.262
So that's basically what
