00:21:56.460 --> 00:22:01.710
it's very similar, except that
you would now have the ability

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:05.370
to scale this thing out
to really fast hardware,

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:07.620
and really fast processing.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:08.190
Yes.

