00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:12.810
The idea being that
out of the box,

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:15.146
we want our estimators to
actually work on a TPU,

00:23:15.146 --> 00:23:17.590
without you having
to change your code.

00:23:17.590 --> 00:23:20.710
Today because TPUs are new
