00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:28.810
those kinds of things.

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.080
But we want to get to the point
where it's just automatic.

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.940
You run on a TPU.

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:39.849
And this graph modification
just happens on that device

00:23:39.849 --> 00:23:40.640
before it happened.

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:41.470
Right.

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:43.040
So that's our end goal.

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:44.060
We want to get there.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:45.574
But right now,
until we get there,

00:23:45.574 --> 00:23:46.990
these are the few
changes we make.

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:49.600
